                            {
                                "example_id": "5bef0b23-9ccf-4572-b04d-495ceb44241a",
                                "sense_id": "d1b9c052-4f8d-33e8-989b-dbef0b475bdf",
                                "text": "While watching the VOD later, xQc insinuated that Fortnite pro Bucke was an \"NPC\" who was only there to defend Tate and not give Piker a fair shot – and what resulted afterward has caused quite a stir in its own right."
